2 x 18 MiB",fillcolor="#e6f5ee"];
kv[label="Full-attention KV
48 MiB @4K",fillcolor="#e6f5ee"];
scratch[label="Prefill hidden / QKV / z / o
Lifetime-managed DDR scratch",fillcolor="#e6f5ee"];
rd[label="Read queues / ID / credit
4 KiB burst split",fillcolor="#eaf2ff"];
wr[label="Write queues / burst staging
B-response tracking",fillcolor="#eaf2ff"];
local[label="Local working set ~1.32 MiB
Head slots / KV / FFN / partial",fillcolor="#e6f5ee"];
param[label="Region limits / bank locks
Cache flush / invalidate",fillcolor="#fff2d9"];
pool->weight[label="Allocate",style=dashed,color="#986336"];
pool->head[label="Allocate",style=dashed,color="#986336"];
